                           <locus target="#Throughout all the text">-Throughout all the text</locus>
                           <q xml:lang="ar">Notes marked "Šarqāwī", "Zayyādī", "Birmāwī", "Damīrī", "Rawā al-Ḏahabī", "Zawāǧir".</q>
